albox.co/shows/7faa58ac-08f7-4870-9ebe-20007ebd440d.jpg","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/9ca17694-aca7-44de-a1e9-daaf9f68c1d5.JPG","likes":248,"dislikes":4,"views":13711,"release_date":"896227200000","season_number":1,"description":"After breaking off her engagement on her wedding day and going directly to a prostitution house, a young model becomes the city's most famous harlot, known as \"Hilda Hurricane\", in the 50's Brazil. She could do fine if it wasn't for Malthus, a young novice said to be a saint, for whom she falls in love. However, the boy is kept under the strict, severe doctrine of Father Nelson, a conservative priest intolerant even to every minor sin. Things start getting harder when Roberto, Malthus' old friend and a communist reporter (the actual author of the story), tries to interview Hilda and disclosure the real reasons behind her radical change of mind. In the meantime, the middle-classes are terrified by the \"leftist threat\" in Brazilian politics.\r\n\r\n","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.2}],"value":8.2,"age":"PG-14"},"background_color":"#ed92ac","current_season_id":24092,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}